<!-- ==================== TAB 6: CRM E PIPELINE ==================== -->
<div class="tab-panel" id="panel-6">
  <h2>CRM e Pipeline -- Checklist Diario</h2>
  <p class="section-desc">Se nao esta no CRM, nao existe. Siga este checklist todo dia as 8h.</p>

  <h3>Checklist Diario do Vendedor (8h)</h3>
  <div class="card card-highlight">
